{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"7cfd0f7ede9e6a98b1932bc84ae1a61e5449ad0039f95ebeb439ffee3b4ebab4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":14,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["预言旱灾"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华告诉耶利米有关旱灾的事："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"“犹大悲泣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的城邑衰败，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人人坐在地上痛哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷哀鸣四起。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"贵族派仆人去水池打水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仆人去那里发现没有水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就带着空瓶垂头丧气、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"羞愧地抱头而归。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天不下雨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"土地干裂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"农夫沮丧地抱着头。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为没有草，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"田野的母鹿抛弃了刚生下来的小鹿；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为没有草，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"野驴站在光秃的山头上像豺狼一样喘气，双目无神。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"耶和华啊，虽然我们的罪控告我们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们屡屡叛逆得罪你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你为了自己的名而拯救我们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的盼望和患难时的救主啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你为什么在本地像个异乡人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像个只住一夜的客旅呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你为什么像个受惊的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像个无力救人的勇士呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，你一直都在我们中间，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们属于你的名下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你不要抛弃我们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"关于这些百姓，耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“他们喜欢游荡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不约束自己的脚步，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此耶和华不悦纳他们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"现在祂要追忆他们的罪恶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"追讨他们的罪。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["耶和华对我说：“你不要为这百姓求好处。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["即使他们禁食，我也不会听他们的呼求；他们献上燔祭和素祭，我也不会悦纳。我要用刀剑、饥荒和瘟疫灭绝他们。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["我说：“主耶和华啊！众先知不停地告诉他们不会有战争，也不会遭遇饥荒，说耶和华必在这地方赐给他们永久的平安。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["耶和华对我说：“那些先知奉我的名说假预言，我并没有差派他们，没有委任他们，也没有对他们说话。他们对你们说的预言是假异象，是占卜，是他们心中的妄想。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["我没有差派他们，他们却奉我的名预言这地方必没有刀剑和饥荒。他们必死于刀剑和饥荒。这是耶和华说的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["听他们说预言的人及其妻子儿女，必因饥荒和战争而暴尸耶路撒冷街头，无人掩埋。因为我要使他们受到应得的报应。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"“耶利米，你要对他们说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘让我昼夜泪眼汪汪吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我的处女同胞遭受重创，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"伤势危重。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我走到田间，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眼前是死于刀下的尸体；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我进入城里，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"见饥荒肆虐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先知和祭司也流亡异乡","poem":1},{"noteId":4},{"text":"。’”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"耶和华啊，你完全丢弃犹大了吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你厌恶锡安吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你为什么重重地打我们，以致无法医治？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们期待平安，却没有祥和；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"渴望得到医治，却饱受惊吓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，我们承认自己和我们祖先的罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们诚然得罪了你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为了你的尊名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你不要厌恶我们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要让你荣耀的宝座蒙羞。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你顾念你与我们立的约，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要废除它。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在列国供奉的偶像中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁能赐下雨水呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天能自降甘霖吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们的上帝耶和华啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道不是只有你能行这些事吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是你行了这一切，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我们仰望你。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":4,"caller":"+","text":"“先知和祭司也流亡异乡”或译“连先知和祭司也浑浑噩噩，茫然无措”。","reference":{"chapter":14,"verse":18}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/14.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/15.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/13.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}